default, not a bug. the log shipper resets to seven days whenever the config map
is recreated, and nobody notices until you need the old logs.
sam.rivera: which is always the worst possible moment, and it turns an ops
incident into a compliance one because we lose the evidence trail.
riley.nakamura: I pinned an alert that fires if retention drops below ninety days
