seed gmail ask-gmail-0008 "Vendra security review — findings" email 2026-05-20 <<'NOTE'
Legal finished reviewing Vendra's security questionnaire and I have concerns
before we counter-sign. Vendra could not produce a current SOC 2 report, their
data-residency answers were vague, and they declined a breach-notification window
shorter than thirty days. I want a security addendum that pins a seventy-two-hour
